ray\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-6.3.2b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^\\prime\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L^\\prime}\">\\(T^\\prime\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L^\\prime}\\)</span> 为候选扩张理论。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0\\)</span> is the canonical reduct from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a>, defined for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)\\)</span>. All reduct occurrences below use that language-pair interface.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>有限元组满足记号采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>；合并参数元组时按显示顺序作有限序列拼接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,L&#39;\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L,L&#39;\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,n}\\)</span> (languages and relation symbols, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,L&#39;\">\\(L,L&#39;\\)</span> have identical variable and logical-symbol components. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is a fresh nonlogical symbol, of relation kind and arity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>; the projection names are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> (sentences and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-variable formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T&#39;)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T&#39;)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_L\\)</span> (assignments and satisfaction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L,L&#39;\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Const}_{L&#39;}=\\mathrm{Const}_L\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Func}_{L&#39;,k}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L,k})\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land R\\notin\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}(\\mathrm{Func}_{L,k}\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,k})\n\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,n}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\cup\\{R\\}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(k\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,k}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,k})\n\\land\nT&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Biggl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T&#39;)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\!\\upharpoonright L\n=\n\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L\n\\to\nR^{\\mathfrak A}=R^{\\mathfrak B}\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T&#39;)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;(s(x_i)=\\bar a(i))\n\\to\n\\bigl[\n\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L\n(\\mathfrak A\\!\\upharpoonright L,s,\\varphi)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L,L&#39;\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Const}_{L&#39;}=\\mathrm{Const}_L\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Func}_{L&#39;,k}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L,k})\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land R\\notin\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}(\\mathrm{Func}_{L,k}\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,k})\n\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,n}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\cup\\{R\\}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(k\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,k}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,k})\n\\land\nT&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Biggl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T&#39;)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\!\\upharpoonright L\n=\n\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L\n\\to\nR^{\\mathfrak A}=R^{\\mathfrak B}\n\\Bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T&#39;)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;(s(x_i)=\\bar a(i))\n\\to\n\\bigl[\n\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L\n(\\mathfrak A\\!\\upharpoonright L,s,\\varphi)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The left side is implicit definability of the new relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> by uniqueness over a fixed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-reduct. The right side is parameter-free explicit definition by one <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-formula.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The fresh relation is inserted into its arity component. The language codes themselves are not sets of nonlogical symbols.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-mode